# Share a calendar event

Invite a colleague to an existing Calendar event.

This guide shows how to invite someone to an event you **already** created.

## Prerequisites

- A Mac signed in to iCloud
- An existing event

## Open the event

### 1. Click **Calendar** in the Dock

![Click Calendar in the Dock](images/01-click-calendar-in-the-dock.png)

### 2. Double-click the *Team sync* event

![Double-click the Team sync event](images/02-double-click-the-team-sync-event.png)

The event opens in its own window.

> **Tip:** You can also select the event and press `⌘O` to open it.

## Invite people

### 3. Type the guest's email in **Add Invitees**

![Type the guest's email in Add Invitees](images/03-type-the-guest-s-email-in-add-invitees.png)

Separate several guests with commas.

- Guests get an email invite
- You can remove them later

### 4. Right-click the guest and choose **Send Email**

![Right-click the guest and choose Send Email](images/04-right-click-the-guest-and-choose-send-email.png)

### 5. Press `⌘S` to save

![Press ⌘S to save](images/05-press-s-to-save.png)

> **Note:** Guests see changes after they [refresh their calendar](https://support.apple.com/guide/calendar/welcome/mac).

